// newtOverLayout, and what only it reaches: the NewtApp framework's default
// overview layout (NPR "newtOverLayout"), based on newtLayout and on the
// protoOverview functions it shares with the system's overviews (the slots
// below set to functions of the same name).  It has no children: it draws one
// line per entry (the shapes Abstract returns) with a check box column at the
// left, keeps the checked entries as aliases in `selected`, and hands them to
// filing, routing and delete as a target cursor.

